47b4901-e01a-47f3-82a9-2c53b669ea76?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=431c679c756a72735f60708e8a482483", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7fec68c3/uploads/origins/147b4901-e01a-47f3-82a9-2c53b669ea76?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=431c679c756a72735f60708e8a482483, https://si.imgix.net/7fec68c3/uploads/origins/147b4901-e01a-47f3-82a9-2c53b669ea76?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=193970682ee8eb41d7409eed1dc69cd8 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7fec68c3/uploads/origins/147b4901-e01a-47f3-82a9-2c53b669ea76?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=50567459699fdf49d1dbfa418615745c 3x", "genre": "comic", "nsfw": true, "body": "https://x.com/hounori/status/751393751247888386/photo/1\n少年に頼み込まれた彼女が困惑し羞恥に悶えつつ半脱ぎでアナルを見せる\n\n　「(つるつる無毛の尻に)うわあ！なんて綺麗なお尻…😆」\n　「(指でつんつんしながら)肉感・張り・つや・どれも素晴らしいです🧐」\n　「(尻を鷲掴みにし)それにこの穴…なんて美しいんだろう……😳」\n　「(スンスンしながら)いい香り…たまらないです😩  ぺろっ👅」\n　『ひあっ！？😅』\n\n時間経過の描写\n\n　「今日はありがとうございました！またどうかよろしくお願い致します😄」\n　『…え！？あ……うん…またね😅』\n\n上記もしよろしければ お願い致します", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@hounori/works/122", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/7f2cd726/uploads/origins/8de8fa53-60a0-4a64-b488-7caa67ba3b19?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a4cfbb07bbc4e15851ebb6e77d7cca2b", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7f2cd726/uploads/origins/8de8fa53-60a0-4a64-b488-7caa67ba3b19?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a4cfbb07bbc4e15851ebb6e77d7cca2b, https://si.imgix.net/7f2cd726/uploads/origins/8de8fa53-60a0-4a64-b488-7caa67ba3b19?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=95c8c0f032a0ec5562f21cc5350b4945 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7f2cd726/uploads/origins/8de8fa53-60a0-4a64-b488-7caa67ba3b19?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1e2e96a5318292abe116091735ae127a 3x", "genre": "comic", "nsfw": true, "body": "Hello again! Thanks again for the comic you did for me previously! \n\nThis time I'd like you request a short comic where my forest fairy (https://sta.sh/2tvy9uc1blw) and a friend's forest nymph (https://www.deviantart.com/stash/21ajwhvvmij3) lure a unsuspecting hiker deep into the forest and have sex with him.\n\nPlease have the fairy finding ways to help herself get off with the nymph and the hiker despite her size.\n\nThank you", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@hounori/works/121", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/da867ea5/uploads/origins/a43d1f02-99be-4160-a627-2fa6f2b9142e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=be58634dd1eb5cc698dfced26f15b1da", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/da867ea5/uploads/origins/a43d1f02-99be-4160-a627-2fa6f2b9142e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=be58634dd1eb5cc698dfced26f15b1da, https://si.imgix.net/da867ea5/uploads/origins/a43d1f02-99be-4160-a627-2fa6f2b9142e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2a78ae737d0f05f2a22ea44e28d657b0 2x, https://si.imgix.net/da867ea5/uploads/origins/a43d1f02-99be-4160-a627-2fa6f2b9142e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e0b6bd51edfcf40ee1dab6458a498cbb 3x", "genre": "comic", "nsfw": true, "body": "Hello!😄\nI hope you are well!🎉\n\nPlease draw my OCs!\n\n🌊シマ . ウミコ : https://catbox.moe/c/h8wow0\nSexy surfer lady!🏄‍♀️39歳\nHer life revolves around surfing & the ocean!🎏\nFormer businesswoman. She loved the ocean so much she abandoned city life to live on the waves.🌊\nPieces of her suit still remain. Faded & torn with time & salt water!\nPonytail resembles a dolphin.🐬\nDespite her age she has a playful personality! No responsibilities in life, & only cares about having fun.\n\n🎣ヨシウミ . ゴー : https://catbox.moe/c/a7k1g5\nHandsome fisherman boy. 27歳\nAthletic body, big penis.\nHis body has lots of scars. But a very pretty face.\nCarefree & laid back personality.  ゴー is typically quiet which contrasts with ウミコ.\nHe's madly in love with ウミコ, thinks she's the most amazing woman in the world!💞\n\nThey're homeless & travel the ocean together.\nBest friends that are always together!\nFun at the beach every day, having sex often.\n\nDraw them any way you want!\nScenario & poses entirely up to you!\nThanks!🐬🐟", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@hounori/works/120", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/8c4f06a0/uploads/origins/3d40376c-78aa-4466-884d-af9f915dff83?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f4fbd712e7b6d5e0f3062b6d967d05fd", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8c4f06a0/uploads/origins/3d40376c-78aa-4466-884d-af9f915dff83?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f4fbd712e7b6d5e0f3062b6d967d05fd, https://si.imgix.net/8c4f06a0/uploads/origins/3d40376c-78aa-4466-884d-af9f915dff83?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5dc0fdf8dd7f3f84e984b39e52b1c599 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8c4f06a0/uploads/origins/3d40376c-78aa-4466-884d-af9f915dff83?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a19f84bfc072fb37d276756a933c1307 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "Hello, it's nice to meet you. If it's alright, could I make a request for three of my goblin characters please?\n\nPandora: The goblin with white hair. 132 cm tall. Shy, sensitive, and kind. Loves her friends.\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1OOTwkQdAK5Bg1srE7_275t8hJo82cq0d\n\nLycoria: The goblin with dark hair. 138 cm tall. Strict and serious, but she has a gentle side. Treats Pandora like a little sister.\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1KRBwt4nMqtuHXhDBAurLr041s6cOo2qz?usp=sharing\n\nSumire: The goblin with blonde hair. 120 cm tall. Seems cheerful, but has a melancholy side underneath.\nhttps://drive.g